      "comment": "ON APPEAL (7) has been in the minors the last two, the latest showing strong pace early but gathered in and finished a half a length second over 340m this track in 20.06. Capable of going well again. NOAH BONKERS (8) turned in a moderate run last time when eighth at Dubbo over 318m behind Classic Lass (19.43) in a Grade 5. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Better than last start and can bounce back. WALTZIN' ETHICS (4) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing sixth (20.76) in a Grade 5 at this track. Has ability and is one of the better chances. TIPSY ETHICS (1) can finish much closer after missing a cheque at this track last start.",
